# WIREFRAME-ISM: Wireframe view draws instanced static meshes (the S1 scattered trees/shrubs) through the same
# path as plain meshes, as UE does. FIELD_Barn has 16 ISM entities; before the fix they vanished in Wireframe
# while their shadows were still drawn. View from FOLIAGE-PROOF 1_field_grass.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 70
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Когда run View "View mode: Wireframe"
Тогда-вид 1_wire wireframes of the scattered trees and shrubs visible like the barn's wireframe; editor.log has no ISM render error
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Тогда-вид 2_lit the same view lit: the trees are in place (no regression)
